1
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:05,444
Every organization is made of people.

2
00:00:05,744 --> 00:00:08,060
And when we take care of our people,

3
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:11,030
we strengthen everything around them.

4
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:14,370
That's why we started by listening.

5
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:18,367
We began an employee well-being assessment,

6
00:00:18,387 --> 00:00:20,403
looking beyond numbers,

7
00:00:20,503 --> 00:00:23,377
and taking the time to understand the real

8
00:00:23,397 --> 00:00:27,323
experiences, needs, and challenges of our people.

9
00:00:27,923 --> 00:00:30,424
We listened to employees across different

10
00:00:30,444 --> 00:00:33,131
professional groups, nationalities, genders,

11
00:00:33,151 --> 00:00:35,300
and areas of the business.

12
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:38,279
We also listened to our leaders.

13
00:00:38,379 --> 00:00:40,754
To understand the challenges they see,

14
00:00:40,774 --> 00:00:44,223
and where we can make the greatest difference.

15
00:00:44,873 --> 00:00:47,280
What we heard was clear.

16
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:50,733
Our people need greater support for their

17
00:00:50,753 --> 00:00:53,703
mental health and financial well-being.

18
00:00:54,703 --> 00:00:56,827
And we believe well-being is not

19
00:00:56,847 --> 00:00:59,340
a one-size-fits-all solution.

20
00:00:59,590 --> 00:01:01,965
It's about creating the right support,

21
00:01:01,985 --> 00:01:05,434
for different people, in different situations.

22
00:01:06,084 --> 00:01:08,441
Based on the assessment, we have developed

23
00:01:08,461 --> 00:01:12,067
recommendations focused on the areas that matter most.

24
00:01:12,517 --> 00:01:15,900
Starting in Q4 2026,

25
00:01:16,750 --> 00:01:20,830
we will begin turning these recommendations into action.

26
00:01:21,530 --> 00:01:24,577
More details will be shared with you shortly,

27
00:01:24,677 --> 00:01:26,897
including our detailed action plan

28
00:01:26,917 --> 00:01:30,103
and the support available to our people.

29
00:01:30,803 --> 00:01:33,536
Because your well-being matters.

30
00:01:34,486 --> 00:01:38,054
And taking care of our people isn't just a program.

31
00:01:38,254 --> 00:01:40,569
It's part of who we are.
